# Line endings
#
# This repo is output-only: every file here is generated by build.py in the
# private source repo (grosirin/grosirinweb-dev) and copied across. That
# build previously wrote CRLF on Windows and LF elsewhere, so a promotion
# prepared on a different machine rewrote every line of every page and the
# real change vanished into the diff.
#
# LF is canonical here, matching the source repo. The generator also pins
# newline="\n" on every text write, so the output is byte-identical wherever
# it is built.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never pass through the text filters.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
